  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 29 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}小熊是海带吗！？\n泡水后会熬出好喝的高汤！？\n是家常菜的基础调味吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e400_030.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}高汤……？\n……哼哼，没错熊！\n小熊是每家必备一台的必需品熊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e400_030.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
